     * @param _projectId The project id.
     * @param _description A short description of the milestone work.
     * @param _amount The ETH value (in wei) to be locked for this milestone.
     * @return The newly created milestone id.
     * @dev Called by the FREELANCER. Milestones may be created at any point in the
     *      project lifecycle (before funding, during work, or to add a new phase
     *      after a previous phase completed). Adding a milestone to a completed
